      "summary": ": Saturday 8/8 We have got a similar day to yesterday on the cards, expecting a mainly fine day ahead with some high cloud coming and going. There is a chance of a snow showers later this afternoon / evening. The snow is in great condition! Come on up and make the most of it and grab yourself a great view with some even better food from one of our restaurants. Big bucks has got another jump! Jump 2 is open. Event: The BaseNZ Junior Freeride is on today in Arcadia Chutes! Things will be kicking off around 10:30am! Main Basin lifts will be running from 08:30am with Captains, T-Bar, Soho and Willows to follow from 09:00am. The road is chain free, please turn your head lights on. Passes: Everyone with a season's pass will need a picture on their profile/pass this year. If you're unsure if you have one, pop into any Guest Services location and they will be able to sort you out. -- Learners Slope Open Main Basin Open Captains Open Soho Open Little Willows Open Big Willows Open Ski Touring Access Open Mt Cardrona Open Arcadia Chutes Closed Summit Open",
